	(text "FAN RAIL jumper is OPEN by default: no fan voltage until a choice is made (FR-D02).\nBridge 1-2 = 24 V direct, 2-3 = buck (5 V or 12 V). Silkscreen warning next to the jumper.\nWith 24 V direct the buck runs unloaded (pulse skipping, a few mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "335af0f2-4e45-58f1-8fa8-bb7a24e49294")
	)
	(text "Buck 2: same converter as the 5 V rail. JP_FVSEL bridged (default) = 0.8 x (1 + 39k/7.5k) = 4.96 V;\ncut = 0.8 x (1 + 107k/7.5k) = 12.2 V. Compensation 12k + 8.2nF // 47pF (calculations.md §5)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
